<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>HiddenGaon — Making Invisible Problems Visible</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<!-- ================= NAVBAR ================= -->

<header class="navbar">

    <a href="#home" class="logo">
        Hidden<span>Gaon</span>
    </a>

    <nav>
        <a href="#explore">Explore</a>
        <a href="#insights">Insights</a>
        <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
        <a href="#solutions">Solutions</a>
    </nav>

    <a href="#report" class="nav-button">
        + Share Problem
    </a>

</header>


<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <p class="eyebrow">
            COMMUNITY • VOICE • ACTION
        </p>

        <h1>
            Some problems are visible.
            <br>
            <span>Some are simply accepted.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
            HiddenGaon helps rural communities discover, share and understand
            everyday problems that often go unnoticed.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">

            <a href="#explore" class="primary-button">
                Explore Problems →
            </a>

            <a href="#report" class="secondary-button">
                Share Your Experience
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="hero-visual">

        <div class="sun"></div>

        <div class="hill hill-one"></div>
        <div class="hill hill-two"></div>

        <div class="house house-one">🏠</div>
        <div class="house house-two">🏡</div>

        <div class="tree tree-one">🌳</div>
        <div class="tree tree-two">🌳</div>

        <div class="floating-card">
            <small>HIDDEN PROBLEM</small>
            <strong>Waste collection</strong>
            <span>Reported by community</span>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= INTRO ================= -->

<section class="intro">

    <div class="container intro-grid">

        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">WHY HIDDEN GAON?</p>

            <h2>
                What exists on paper
                <br>
                isn't always what people experience.
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="intro-text">

            <p>
                A hospital may exist, but reaching it may be difficult.
                A smartphone may exist, but using digital services may not
                be easy.
            </p>

            <p>
                HiddenGaon looks beyond visible infrastructure and asks:
            </p>

            <strong>
                "What problems have people simply learned to live with?"
            </strong>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= VISIBLE VS HIDDEN ================= -->

<section class="comparison">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">LOOK CLOSER</p>

            <h2>
                The problem behind
                <span>the problem.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="comparison-grid">

            <div class="compare-card visible">

                <div class="compare-label">
                    VISIBLE
                </div>

                <div class="compare-icon">
                    🏥
                </div>

                <h3>
                    A healthcare centre exists.
                </h3>

                <p>
                    The facility is visible on the map.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="arrow">
                →
            </div>


            <div class="compare-card hidden">

                <div class="compare-label">
                    HIDDEN
                </div>

                <div class="compare-icon">
                    🚶
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Reaching it isn't easy.
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Distance, transportation or accessibility
                    may make the service difficult to use.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="mini-comparisons">

            <div>
                <span>📱</span>
                <strong>Smartphone exists</strong>
                <small>Digital service may still be difficult to use.</small>
            </div>

            <div>
                <span>🚻</span>
                <strong>Toilet exists</strong>
                <small>Water, maintenance or accessibility may be missing.</small>
            </div>

            <div>
                <span>🌾</span>
                <strong>Crop is produced</strong>
                <small>Getting a fair market opportunity can be difficult.</small>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= EXPLORE ================= -->

<section class="explore" id="explore">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE</p>

            <h2>
                What is hidden?
            </h2>

            <p>
                Explore the everyday challenges communities may experience.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="category-grid">


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Food">

                <div class="category-icon">🍚</div>

                <h3>Food</h3>

                <p>
                    Nutrition, food access, storage and wastage.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Waste">

                <div class="category-icon">🗑️</div>

                <h3>Garbage & Waste</h3>

                <p>
                    Collection, segregation and disposal.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Farmers">

                <div class="category-icon">🌾</div>

                <h3>Farmers</h3>

                <p>
                    Markets, storage, transport and information.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Water">

                <div class="category-icon">💧</div>

                <h3>Water</h3>

                <p>
                    Availability, quality and access.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Healthcare">

                <div class="category-icon">🏥</div>

                <h3>Healthcare</h3>

                <p>
                    Access, distance and awareness.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Education">

                <div class="category-icon">🎓</div>

                <h3>Education</h3>

                <p>
                    Resources, opportunities and guidance.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Women">

                <div class="category-icon">👩</div>

                <h3>Women</h3>

                <p>
                    Health, privacy, mobility and opportunities.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


            <div class="category-card" data-category="Elderly">

                <div class="category-icon">🧓</div>

                <h3>Elderly</h3>

                <p>
                    Mobility, digital access and independence.
                </p>

                <span>Explore →</span>

            </div>


        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= INSIGHTS ================= -->

<section class="insights" id="insights">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading light">

            <p class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY INSIGHTS</p>

            <h2>
                What are people saying?
            </h2>

            <p>
                Sample dashboard — replace these numbers with your
                actual field research.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="dashboard">


            <div class="dashboard-main">

                <div class="dashboard-header">

                    <div>
                        <small>COMMUNITY REPORTS</small>
                        <h3>Top concerns</h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="report-number">
                        248
                        <small>responses</small>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="progress-item">

                    <div>
                        <span>Garbage & Waste</span>
                        <strong>68%</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <span style="width:68%"></span>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="progress-item">

                    <div>
                        <span>Transportation</span>
                        <strong>61%</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <span style="width:61%"></span>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="progress-item">

                    <div>
                        <span>Healthcare</span>
                        <strong>54%</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <span style="width:54%"></span>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="progress-item">

                    <div>
                        <span>Digital Literacy</span>
                        <strong>47%</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <span style="width:47%"></span>
                    </div>

                </div>


            </div>


            <div class="priority-card">

                <small>PRIORITY BOARD</small>

                <h3>
                    Needs attention
                </h3>

                <div class="priority">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <p>Waste management</p>
                </div>

                <div class="priority">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <p>Transportation</p>
                </div>

                <div class="priority">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <p>Healthcare access</p>
                </div>

                <div class="priority">
                    <span>04</span>
                    <p>Digital literacy</p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= PROBLEM JOURNEY ================= -->

<section class="journey">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">FROM PROBLEM TO ACTION</p>

            <h2>
                What happens after
                <span>you speak?</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="journey-line">

            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="step-number">01</div>

                <div class="step-icon">🗣️</div>

                <h3>Report</h3>

                <p>
                    A community member shares a problem.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="step-number">02</div>

                <div class="step-icon">🔎</div>

                <h3>Understand</h3>

                <p>
                    The problem is categorized and studied.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="step-number">03</div>

                <div class="step-icon">🏛️</div>

                <h3>Connect</h3>

                <p>
                    Relevant stakeholders can see the issue.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="step-number">04</div>

                <div class="step-icon">🛠️</div>

                <h3>Act</h3>

                <p>
                    Possible actions can be explored and tracked.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= STORIES ================= -->

<section class="stories" id="stories">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">STORIES BEHIND THE NUMBERS</p>

            <h2>
                Real problems have
                <span>real people behind them.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="story-grid">


            <article class="story-card">

                <div class="story-top">

                    <span>TRANSPORTATION</span>

                    <span>ANONYMOUS</span>

                </div>

                <blockquote>
                    "Getting to the hospital is harder than getting treatment."
                </blockquote>

                <p>
                    An everyday transportation difficulty can become
                    a healthcare access problem.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="story-card">

                <div class="story-top">

                    <span>WASTE</span>

                    <span>ANONYMOUS</span>

                </div>

                <blockquote>
                    "The garbage is collected sometimes, but where should it go?"
                </blockquote>

                <p>
                    Waste management is not only about collection.
                    Disposal and segregation matter too.
                </p>

            </article>


        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= SOLUTIONS ================= -->

<section class="solutions" id="solutions">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">POSSIBLE SOLUTIONS</p>

            <h2>
                Don't just find problems.
                <span>Find possibilities.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="solution-grid">


            <div class="solution-card">

                <div class="solution-icon">
                    🗑️
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Waste
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Segregation awareness, regular collection,
                    responsible disposal and local clean-up initiatives.
                </p>

                <small>
                    POSSIBLE STAKEHOLDERS
                </small>

                <strong>
                    Gram Panchayat • Local organizations
                </strong>

            </div>


            <div class="solution-card">

                <div class="solution-icon">
                    🌾
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Farmers
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Better access to market information,
                    storage, transport and agricultural resources.
                </p>

                <small>
                    POSSIBLE STAKEHOLDERS
                </small>

                <strong>
                    Agriculture groups • FPOs • NGOs
                </strong>

            </div>


            <div class="solution-card">

                <div class="solution-icon">
                    📱
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Digital Literacy
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Simple tutorials, digital safety awareness
                    and community learning sessions.
                </p>

                <small>
                    POSSIBLE STAKEHOLDERS
                </small>

                <strong>
                    Schools • NGOs • Community groups
                </strong>

            </div>


        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= REPORT ================= -->

<section class="report" id="report">

    <div class="container report-container">

        <div class="report-intro">

            <p class="eyebrow">
                YOUR VOICE MATTERS
            </p>

            <h2>
                What's something
                <span>people have stopped questioning?</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Tell us about an everyday problem in your community.
                Your response can help make an invisible problem visible.
            </p>

        </div>


        <form id="problemForm">


            <div class="form-row">

                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>
                        Problem category
                    </label>

                    <select required>

                        <option value="">
                            Select category
                        </option>

                        <option>Food</option>
                        <option>Waste</option>
                        <option>Farmers</option>
                        <option>Water</option>
                        <option>Healthcare</option>
                        <option>Education</option>
                        <option>Transportation</option>
                        <option>Women</option>
                        <option>Elderly</option>

                    </select>

                </div>


                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>
                        Village / Area
                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        placeholder="Enter location"
                        required
                    >

                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="form-group">

                <label>
                    What is the problem?
                </label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    placeholder="Describe the problem briefly"
                    required
                >

            </div>


            <div class="form-group">

                <label>
                    Tell us more
                </label>

                <textarea
                    placeholder="Who is affected? What happens?"
                ></textarea>

            </div>


            <div class="form-options">

                <label class="checkbox">

                    <input type="checkbox">

                    Submit anonymously

                </label>

                <label class="upload">

                    📷 Add photo

                    <input
                        type="file"
                        accept="image/*"
                        hidden
                    >

                </label>

            </div>


            <button
                type="submit"
                class="primary-button submit-button"
            >
                Submit Community Report →
            </button>


        </form>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->

<section class="about">

    <div class="container about-grid">

        <div>

            <p class="eyebrow">
                ABOUT HIDDEN GAON
            </p>

            <h2>
                We don't assume
                the problem.
                <span>We listen.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div>

            <p>
                HiddenGaon is a community-centered platform concept
                developed to identify everyday rural problems through
                observation, conversations and community participation.
            </p>

            <p>
                The goal is simple:
            </p>

            <strong class="big-text">
                Discover → Understand → Act
            </strong>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


